@startuml GraphRAG_Greenwashing_Sequence_Diagram
title UML Sequence Diagram: Runtime Execution of Graph-RAG Greenwashing Detection System
autonumber
skinparam Style strictuml
skinparam SequenceMessageAlignment left

' Dynamic spacing & layout formatting for thesis-level clarity
skinparam BoxPadding 30
skinparam ParticipantPadding 25
skinparam MaxMessageSize 220
skinparam ResponseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam NotePadding 10
skinparam Padding 5

actor "User" as User
participant "Web UI" as WebUI
participant "Backend API" as Backend
participant "Annual Report\nRepo" as ReportRepo
participant "News Repo" as NewsRepo
participant "ESG Preprocessor" as Preprocess
participant "ViDeBERTa\nClassifier" as ViDeBERTa
participant "Graph-RAG\nPipeline" as GraphRAG
participant "Gemini 2.5\nFlash" as Gemini
participant "Entity Resolver" as ER
database "Neo4j Graph DB" as Neo4j
participant "Cross-check\nEngine" as Crosscheck
participant "LLM Adjudicator" as LLMAdj
participant "Dossier Generator" as DossierGen
database "System DB" as DB

== Phase 1: Request Initialization & Data Ingestion ==

User -> WebUI : 1. Select company & request ESG/Greenwashing analysis
activate WebUI
WebUI -> Backend : 2. Send analysis request (POST /api/analyze)
activate Backend

par Concurrent Data Fetching
    Backend -> ReportRepo : 3a. Load annual report data
    activate ReportRepo
    ReportRepo --> Backend : Return report text documents
    deactivate ReportRepo
else
    Backend -> NewsRepo : 3b. Load independent ESG news
    activate NewsRepo
    NewsRepo --> Backend : Return news articles
    deactivate NewsRepo
end

Backend -> Preprocess : 4. Invoke text extraction & sentence splitting
activate Preprocess
Preprocess -> Preprocess : 5. Extract text & segment sentences
Preprocess --> Backend : Return candidate sentences
deactivate Preprocess

Backend -> ViDeBERTa : 6. Send candidate sentences
activate ViDeBERTa
ViDeBERTa -> ViDeBERTa : 7. Classify sentences into E / S / G / Neutral
ViDeBERTa --> Backend : 8. Return ESG-related sentences only
deactivate ViDeBERTa

== Phase 2: Graph Construction & Entity Resolution ==

Backend -> GraphRAG : 9. Invoke Graph-RAG Pipeline
activate GraphRAG

alt #EFFFEF Primary Service Available (Gemini 2.5 Flash)
    GraphRAG -> Gemini : 10. Extract entities, temporal relations, KPIs, claims
    activate Gemini
    Gemini --> GraphRAG : 11. Return structured JSON extractions
    deactivate Gemini
else #FFEFEB Alt Flow 2: Gemini Service Unavailable
    GraphRAG -> LLMAdj : 10a. Automatic failover request (OpenAI GPT-4o-mini)
    activate LLMAdj
    LLMAdj --> GraphRAG : 11a. Return structured JSON extractions
    deactivate LLMAdj
end

GraphRAG -> ER : 12. Invoke Entity Resolution Engine
activate ER

opt #FFF8EF Alt Flow 3: Duplicate Entities Detected
    ER -> ER : Merge duplicated entities into canonical entity
end

ER -> ER : 13. Canonicalize names, link standards, stamp provenance
ER --> GraphRAG : Return resolved graph structures
deactivate ER

GraphRAG -> Neo4j : 14. Insert clean entities & temporal relations
activate Neo4j
Neo4j --> GraphRAG : Insertion confirmation
deactivate Neo4j

GraphRAG --> Backend : Graph construction completed
deactivate GraphRAG

== Phase 3: Evidence Retrieval, Cross-checking & Dossier Generation ==

Backend -> Crosscheck : 15. Request Cross-check Engine
activate Crosscheck

Crosscheck -> Neo4j : 16-17. Retrieve claims & candidate conduct evidence
activate Neo4j
Neo4j --> Crosscheck : Return SustainabilityClaim, KPIObservation, MediaReport, Controversy nodes
deactivate Neo4j

alt #FFF8EF Alt Flow 1: No Relevant News Evidence Found
    Crosscheck -> LLMAdj : Send claim with empty context
    activate LLMAdj
    LLMAdj --> Crosscheck : Return "unverified_insufficient_evidence" + caveats
    deactivate LLMAdj
else #EFFFEF Evidence Found: LLM Adjudication
    Crosscheck -> LLMAdj : 18. Send user query & retrieved evidence
    activate LLMAdj
    LLMAdj --> Crosscheck : 19-20. Return assessment, rationale, evidence & caveats
    deactivate LLMAdj
end

Crosscheck -> Neo4j : 21. Write verifiedBy, contradictedBy, contradictedByMedia edges
activate Neo4j
Neo4j --> Crosscheck : Edges written confirmation
deactivate Neo4j

Crosscheck -> DossierGen : 22. Request Evidence Dossier generation
activate DossierGen
DossierGen -> DossierGen : Create complete advisory Evidence Dossier
DossierGen --> Crosscheck : Return Evidence Dossier
deactivate DossierGen

Crosscheck --> Backend : Return Evidence Dossier
deactivate Crosscheck

Backend -> DB : 23. Store Evidence Dossier
activate DB
DB --> Backend : Confirmation saved
deactivate DB

Backend --> WebUI : 24. Return Evidence Dossier
deactivate Backend

WebUI -> WebUI : 25. Visualize supported/contradicted claims & missing disclosures
WebUI --> User : 26. Display Evidence Dossier for human analyst review
deactivate WebUI

@enduml
